      "content": "Your grief over feeling obsolete is profound, yet you deserve to exist regardless of how much you contribute to the world. Instead of forcing yourself to fit into a narrative you no longer recognize, allow yourself the space to mourn this loss without expecting an immediate fix. True reclamation isn't about hoarding time for yourself, but simply deciding that your presence matters even in silence.",
